Hi {Owner},

I build websites for bounce house and inflatable rental companies around {City}. {Business Name} has happy parties all over its social pages, but no site where a parent can see your inflatables, check a Saturday and pay a deposit.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: every bounce house and water slide with sizes and prices, a date check, safety rules, delivery towns and a deposit at booking, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, new units and price changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on a weekday?

